Breakout back to new all-time highs for $COST following a near two-year period of consolidation should help this regain the kind of momentum this showed back from 2023-2025

While i don't love Staples between now & early next year, COST has continued to impress fundamentally & technically & remains one of my top technical picks among Staples stocks.

@IBDinvestors @marketsurge weekly chart from #IBD shows this 12% gain over the last month helping COST to exceed highs which had already been tested back in Spring of this year

